{"seq":1,"slug":"semantic-segmentation","title":"语义分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/semantic-segmentation","wordCount":1315,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"语义分割\">语义分割</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语义分割为图像中的每个像素分配一个类别标签，实现像素级的场景理解。与目标检测输出边界框不同，语义分割输出与输入图像同尺寸的标签图，精确勾勒出每个类别的空间范围。语义分割不区分同类别的不同实例——同类别的所有像素共享相同标签。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[编码器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[高级语义特征]&#10;    C --&gt; D[解码器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[上采样]&#10;    E --&gt; F[像素级分类]&#10;    F --&gt; G[分割掩码]\">graph LR\n    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[编码器]\n    B --&gt; C[高级语义特征]\n    C --&gt; D[解码器]\n    D --&gt; E[上采样]\n    E --&gt; F[像素级分类]\n    F --&gt; G[分割掩码]</pre><p>语义分割的核心架构是编码器-解码器结构。编码器逐步降低空间分辨率同时增加语义信息，解码器将低分辨率的语义特征恢复到原始分辨率。跳跃连接将编码器的高分辨率细节信息直接传递给解码器，帮助恢复精细的空间边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>骨干网络</th>\n<th>Cityscapes mIoU</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FCN</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>VGG-16</td>\n<td>65.3</td>\n<td>全卷积网络</td>\n<td>134M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>U-Net</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>跳跃连接</td>\n<td>31M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepLabV3+</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>ResNet-101</td>\n<td>82.1</td>\n<td>ASPP + 解码器</td>\n<td>63M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SegFormer</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n<td>MiT-B5</td>\n<td>84.0</td>\n<td>Transformer + 轻量头</td>\n<td>85M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask2Former</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>Swin-L</td>\n<td>84.3</td>\n<td>掩码注意力</td>\n<td>216M</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fcn-与全卷积架构\">FCN 与全卷积架构</h2><p>全卷积网络（FCN）是深度学习语义分割的开山之作。它将分类网络的全连接层替换为卷积层，使网络可以接受任意尺寸的输入并输出对应的空间预测图。FCN 通过反卷积（转置卷积）将低分辨率特征图上采样到原始尺寸，并引入跳跃连接融合不同层级的信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;from torchvision.models import resnet50&#10;&#10;class SimpleFCN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_classes):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        backbone = resnet50(weights=&#39;IMAGENET1K_V2&#39;)&#10;        self.encoder = nn.Sequential(*list(backbone.children())[:-2])&#10;        self.classifier = nn.Conv2d(2048, num_classes, 1)&#10;        self.upsample = nn.Upsample(scale_factor=32, mode=&#39;bilinear&#39;, align_corners=False)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        features = self.encoder(x)&#10;        logits = self.classifier(features)&#10;        return self.upsample(logits)&#10;&#10;model = SimpleFCN(num_classes=21)&#10;dummy = torch.randn(1, 3, 512, 512)&#10;output = model(dummy)&#10;print(f&quot;输入: {dummy.shape}, 输出: {output.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision.models </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resnet50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SimpleFCN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_classes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        backbone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resnet50(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IMAGENET1K_V2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backbone.children())[:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_classes, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.upsample </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Upsample(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bilinear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">align_corners</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier(features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.upsample(logits)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SimpleFCN(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_classes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(dummy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 输出: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">output.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>U-Net 是 FCN 思想在医学影像领域的经典实现。它的对称编码器-解码器结构和密集的跳跃连接使其在小数据集上也能取得出色效果。U-Net 的成功证明了跳跃连接对于恢复空间细节的重要性，这一设计被后续几乎所有分割架构采用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph U-Net 架构&#10;        A[输入 572x572] --&gt; B[编码器 Layer1]&#10;        B --&gt; C[编码器 Layer2]&#10;        C --&gt; D[编码器 Layer3]&#10;        D --&gt; E[瓶颈层]&#10;        E --&gt; F[解码器 Layer3]&#10;        F --&gt; G[解码器 Layer2]&#10;        G --&gt; H[解码器 Layer1]&#10;        H --&gt; I[输出分割图]&#10;    end&#10;    B -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| H&#10;    C -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| G&#10;    D -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| F\">graph TB\n    subgraph U-Net 架构\n        A[输入 572x572] --&gt; B[编码器 Layer1]\n        B --&gt; C[编码器 Layer2]\n        C --&gt; D[编码器 Layer3]\n        D --&gt; E[瓶颈层]\n        E --&gt; F[解码器 Layer3]\n        F --&gt; G[解码器 Layer2]\n        G --&gt; H[解码器 Layer1]\n        H --&gt; I[输出分割图]\n    end\n    B -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| H\n    C -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| G\n    D -.-&gt;|跳跃连接| F</pre><h2 id=\"deeplab-与空洞卷积\">DeepLab 与空洞卷积</h2><p>DeepLab 系列是语义分割领域最具影响力的工作之一。其核心技术是空洞卷积（Atrous/Dilated Convolution），通过在卷积核中插入间隔（空洞）来增大感受野而不增加参数量和计算量。这使得网络在保持高分辨率特征图的同时获得大范围的上下文信息。</p>\n<p>ASPP（Atrous Spatial Pyramid Pooling）在 DeepLabV3 中被提出，它使用多个不同空洞率的并行空洞卷积来捕获多尺度上下文信息。ASPP 通常包含 1×1 卷积、三个不同空洞率（6、12、18）的 3×3 空洞卷积和全局平均池化分支，最后将五个分支的特征拼接融合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class ASPP(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv1 = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.conv6 = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 3, padding=6, dilation=6),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.conv12 = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 3, padding=12, dilation=12),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.conv18 = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 3, padding=18, dilation=18),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.pool = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;        self.project = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(out_channels * 5, out_channels, 1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        size = x.shape[2:]&#10;        pool = nn.functional.interpolate(self.pool(x), size=size, mode=&#39;bilinear&#39;, align_corners=False)&#10;        out = torch.cat([self.conv1(x), self.conv6(x), self.conv12(x), self.conv18(x), pool], dim=1)&#10;        return self.project(out)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASPP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels), nn.ReLU())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#